      "timing_source": null,
      "text": "Congressman Don Payne introduced H-Con Res 467 declaring that genocide was occurring in Darfur. Many of us also traveled to the region several times and later passed the Darfur Peace and Accountability Act. Yet even after then-Secretary of State Powell finally declared genocide in 2004, the international community failed to act decisively to stop it. If we'd acted then, we could have saved many innocent lives. If we do the right thing now,",
