      "timing_source": null,
      "text": "We can end the suffering, violence and insecurity that tragically continues to plague the region to this day. Now is the time for the United States to provide high level leadership and press for full humanitarian assistance. In memory and in honor our beloved Don Payne, our great warrior, he did so much for the people of Darfur. Let us do the right thing in his memory so that the next time we say not on our watch, we will mean it. Thank you.",
